msgid "Accepted domains"
msgstr "Accepterede domæner"

msgid ""
"An iframe field that only renders an iframe when its URL is served by "
"one of the domains accepted for this field."
msgstr ""
"Et iframe felt som kun renderer en iframe hvis dens URL peger på et "
"af de domæner der er accepteret for dette felt."

msgid ""
"Embedded as an iframe only for: @domains. Any other URL is rendered as "
"a link."
msgstr ""
"Indlejres kun som iframe for: @domains. Alle andre URLer renderes som "
"links."

msgid ""
"Enter host names such as <em>example.com</em>. A domain matches that "
"host only, so list subdomains such as <em>www.example.com</em> "
"separately. Lines starting with <em>#</em> are treated as comments."
msgstr ""
"Angiv værtsnavne som <em>example.com</em>. Et domæne matcher kun "
"præcis den vært, så subdomæner som <em>www.example.com</em> skal "
"angives for sig. Linjer der starter med <em>#</em> betragtes som "
"kommentarer."

msgid "ITK"
msgstr "ITK"

msgid "Iframe (accepted domains)"
msgstr "Iframe (accepterede domæner)"

msgid ""
"No domains are accepted for this field yet, so every URL is rendered "
"as a link instead of an iframe."
msgstr ""
"Intet domæne er accepteret for dette felt endnu, så alle URLer "
"renderes som links istedet for iframes."

msgid ""
"One domain per line. Only https URLs served by one of these domains "
"are rendered as an iframe; any other URL is rendered as a link. As "
"long as the list is empty, no iframe is rendered."
msgstr ""
"Et domæne pr. linje. Kun https-URLer der peger på et af disse "
"domæner renderes som iframe; alle andre URLer renderes som links. Så "
"længe listen er tom, bliver ingen iframe renderet."

msgid ""
"Only used for the aspect ratio, in pixels, e.g. 800 by 600. The iframe "
"always fills the available width. Without numbers for both, the ratio "
"is 16:9."
msgstr ""
"Bruges kun til billedformatet, i pixels, f.eks. 800 gange 600. Iframen "
"fylder altid hele den tilgængelige bredde. Uden tal i begge felter er "
"formatet 16:9."

msgid "These lines are not valid domains: @domains"
msgstr "Disse linjger er ikke valide domæner: @domains"

msgid "Title, over iframe (accepted domains only)"
msgstr "Titel, over iframe (ved godkendte domæner)"

msgid "View in full screen"
msgstr "Vis i fuld skærm"

msgid ""
"Your browser does not support iframes, but you can visit <a "
"href=\":url\">@text</a>"
msgstr ""
"Din browser understøtter ikke iframes, men du kan besøge <a "
"href=\":url\">@text</a>"

